Subject: [PATCH 13/42] bitproxy: diagnostics screen with redacted log export

Settings > BitProxy > Diagnostics shows VPN state, Always-on / Block,
tunnel and phone DNS address, server group, remote DNS and strategy,
rule count, IPv6 mode (applied and detected), clone detection, upstream
per-app proxy state, last Apply result and versions. 'Export log'
shares the report, the applied config and this app's recent logcat with
all WireGuard private and preshared keys masked (unit tested).
